<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      .container { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; font-size:
      .9em; line-height: 30px; } .header { text-align: center; background-color:
      #4CAF50; padding: 10px; color: white; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
      .content { padding: 20px; background-color: #fff; border-radius: 0 0 8px
      8px; } .content p { margin: 10px 0; } .footer { text-align: center;
      margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <div class="container">
      <div>Dear {{user_name}},</div>
      <div>You have received a new Work Order for your review and acceptance.</div>

      <div style="margin: 20px 0;">
        <strong>Work Order Details:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Work Order Number: <strong>{{workorder_code}}</strong></li>
          <li>Issue Date: <strong>{{issueDate}}</strong></li>
          <li>Issuer: <strong>{{issuer}}</strong></li>
          <li>Service: <strong>{{service}}</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div>
          If you have any questions or concerns about this work order, please
          contact your project manager or HR department for clarification.
        </div>
        <div>
          Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: -10px;">Best regards,</div>
        <div>AXIA Human Resources Department</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>